    {
      "block_id": "2605.23244_p14_b66",
      "text": "We explicitly step through the COALA method for enhanced clarity. In the following example, we assume the base model\nbeing finetuned is LLaMA-8B and state respective input dimensions.\n",
      "bbox": [
        54.97,
